  body: >-
    When you're arranging accommodation for someone else, the responsibility looks different. You need confidence that the location works, the practical requirements are covered, and the person you're sending will be comfortable, secure, and able to get on with the reason they're traveling. ACOSA helps make that search more manageable.
  image: ../../assets/images/pages/for-companies/heroImage.jpg
