      body: Properties are reviewed before being accepted onto ACOSA.
    - title: Ask for Help When Necessary
      body: If you have specific requirements, a team stay, or cannot immediately identify the right option, contact ACOSA.

teamsAndProjectsSection:
  heading: Need accommodation for more than one traveller?
  image: ../../assets/images/pages/founderStrip/image.jpg
  body: >-
    Tell us where your team needs to be, number of travellers, anticipated dates, expected length of stay, and important accommodation requirements. We'll help identify suitable options within the ACOSA network where possible.
  requirementsList:
    - where your team needs to be
    - number of travellers
    - anticipated dates
    - expected length of stay
    - important accommodation requirements
  primaryCta:
    label: Email Your Requirements
